  "accepted_answers": ["Joe Boyd"],
  "explanation": "Document D1S3 explicitly states that the album *Fables of the Reconstruction* was produced by Joe Boyd. This aligns directly with the question asking who produced the album. While D3S7 and D3S9 mention Dr. Dre in connection with *The Athens Demos*, the title appears to be a misattribution or confusion, as *The Athens Demos* is not otherwise referenced in the provided sources as an actual R.E.M. album. Document D4S4 mentions Elton John as a producer, but it refers to *Fables of the Reconstruction*, not *The Athens Demos*. Therefore, only Joe Boyd is confirmed as the producer of the album in question."
